Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.17,0:00:13.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is that Satoru?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.72,0:00:17.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.82,0:00:23.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.03,0:02:44.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.61,0:02:46.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.50,0:02:49.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What're you doing up so early?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.05,0:02:52.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What, you ask? Isn't that obvious?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.04,0:02:55.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're going to school early again, aren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.23,0:02:56.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.16,0:02:58.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.28,0:03:04.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Slow down. What's the rush?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.71,0:03:08.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Can I just come straight \Nout and ask you something?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.31,0:03:09.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.74,0:03:12.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What're you doing this early, and with whom?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.84,0:03:15.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's a secret.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.86,0:03:18.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's not something bad, I hope.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.28,0:03:21.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.77,0:03:24.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.97,0:03:27.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm off.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.57,0:03:28.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hold up.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.45,0:03:30.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.28,0:03:33.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You'll get hungry before lunch\Nsince you're leaving this early.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.92,0:03:37.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Got it. Thanks, Ma.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.89,0:03:55.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Morning, Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.77,0:03:59.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Morning, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.58,0:04:01.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Here, breakfast.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.37,0:04:03.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't that yours?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.82,0:04:05.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm good. I already ate.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.73,0:04:10.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.57,0:04:13.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Kayo. You must be bored here.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.49,0:04:15.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If only there was a TV here or something...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.09,0:04:21.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's all right. Hiromi brought\Nme lots of books yesterday.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.50,0:04:24.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll be all over in \Na day or two, so hang in there.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.98,0:04:25.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.54,0:04:30.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That was great.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.98,0:04:34.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll see you after school, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.50,0:04:57.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Crap! The Izumi Elementary\Nkids are coming in droves!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.94,0:05:00.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess I spent too long there.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.79,0:05:06.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna give the farewell \Nspeech at the graduation ceremony.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.93,0:05:08.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.97,0:05:11.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why me? You're better at public speaking, Aya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.63,0:05:14.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I know you can do it, Saki.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.55,0:05:19.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Muster up the courage and give it a shot.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.95,0:05:26.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kayo's absent again, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.94,0:05:29.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Have you heard anything, Fujinuma?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.39,0:05:32.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nah. I dropped by her place\Nthis morning, but nobody answered.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.34,0:05:35.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to Hinazuki?\NThink she caught a cold?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.66,0:05:38.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dunno, but it's weird that the school hasn't been informed.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.42,0:05:40.60,GJM_Main,loltiming,0,0,0,,What's wrong?{i can't time this}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.60,0:05:43.74,GJM_Overlap,loltiming,0,0,0,,{\an8}Normally her mom would have called.{i can't time this}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.60,0:05:42.12,GJM_Main,loltiming,0,0,0,,Hinazuki sure is away a lot.{i can't time this}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.62,0:05:44.01,GJM_Main,loltiming,0,0,51,,I wanna skip school too.{i can't time this}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.95,0:05:50.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, knowing Kayo, she'll probably\Nshow up all of a sudden eventually.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.00,0:05:51.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Shall we begin class?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.42,0:05:52.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.53,0:05:58.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you stopped by her place again today?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.55,0:05:59.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You must be worried.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.08,0:06:00.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.44,0:06:03.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And yet you seem to be rather calm.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.74,0:06:05.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Like you always say:
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.78,0:06:09.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,At times like these, you need to\Nkeep calm and carry on as usual.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.29,0:06:10.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.44,0:06:15.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I called Kayo's house \Nyesterday and today, but nobody answered.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.34,0:06:19.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I even called her mother's workplace,\Nbut they said she hadn't come in.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.02,0:06:23.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sensei! Could you call the\N police or the Child Welfare Center?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.29,0:06:25.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The police?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.08,0:06:30.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, wouldn't it cause a certain \Nsomeone trouble if I called them now?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.12,0:06:30.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.96,0:06:37.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I contacted Child Welfare yesterday.\NThey said they were going today.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.17,0:06:40.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going to visit Kayo's place with them too.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.80,0:06:43.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If we want to eliminate the root cause,\Nwe'll probably have to start there.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.73,0:06:47.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And I can't turn back after giving you the\N"Whatever you do, always give it your all" spiel.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.39,0:06:49.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Sensei!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.55,0:06:55.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So Yashiro had already acted to help her!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.36,0:06:56.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.07,0:07:03.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki-san? We're from Ishikari City Hall.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.80,0:07:07.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No answer, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.27,0:07:10.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The lights are on, so somebody must be home.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.83,0:07:12.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go around back and check.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.78,0:07:16.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki-san, are you home?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.13,0:07:19.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kayo?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.89,0:07:24.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.07,0:07:25.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,S-Sensei!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.69,0:07:28.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll take full responsibility.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.98,0:07:32.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The girl's apparently been\Nmissing for three whole days.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.32,0:07:33.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's leave this to him.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.29,0:07:46.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The lights are on, and so is the heater.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.07,0:07:49.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A recent meal for one...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.12,0:07:51.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And Kayo's coat is gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.13,0:07:57.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,At the very least,\Nher mother was here until just now.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.49,0:08:01.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She must've escaped out the \Nveranda the moment we rang the bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.96,0:08:05.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Damn. We would have at least \Nliked to take the girl into custody.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.31,0:08:08.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's come back tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.21,0:08:11.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The mother probably ran out in her nightwear.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.15,0:08:13.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's sure to come back once we leave.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.23,0:08:16.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about the daughter.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.02,0:08:18.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We could ask the police to look for the mother.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.47,0:08:22.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No, Kayo's probably fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.48,0:08:24.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I think I have an idea of where she could be.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.95,0:08:30.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If you say so. Let's take a step \Nback and let the mother settle down.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.76,0:08:33.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,People from the Child Welfare Center made a visit.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.24,0:08:35.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yashiro-sensei, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.96,0:08:38.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Your mom wasn't home.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.09,0:08:41.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure things will be settled tonight or tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.36,0:08:45.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kayo, you'll be separated from your mother.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.87,0:08:48.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing could make me happier.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.80,0:08:52.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Child Welfare taking custody of Hinazuki Kayo
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.31,0:08:54.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}would also mean we wouldn't see her again.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.58,0:08:58.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.11,0:09:02.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thinking about you guys will\Ngive me warmth and strength.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.39,0:09:06.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru. It's a bit late, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.42,0:09:10.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,here's your birthday present.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.71,0:09:11.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.57,0:09:17.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll give you your present tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.21,0:09:18.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's a promise.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.22,0:09:31.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.70,0:09:34.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I get the feeling I've been waiting...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.74,0:09:38.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}for this moment forever.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.92,0:09:44.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're surprisingly emotional, huh, Satoru?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.11,0:09:46.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.78,0:09:50.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Satoru. Stay with me tonight.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.96,0:09:52.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's got guts!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.11,0:09:54.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.50,0:10:01.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing really happened,\Nbut someone came in here late last night.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.58,0:10:03.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I was really scared.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.78,0:10:07.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A security guard on night duty?\NOr maybe the school janitor?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.12,0:10:09.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Any other possibilities?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.02,0:10:13.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe someone came here to hide their dirty mags.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.64,0:10:14.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It was an adult.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.40,0:10:18.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He kicked that cardboard box.\NI think he was mad about something.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.89,0:10:21.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Shall we open it?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.33,0:10:23.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hopefully it's just dirty mags.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.68,0:10:39.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What is this stuff?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.86,0:10:45.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was the only one who realized\Ninstantly what this stuff was for.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.59,0:10:52.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}And it finally hit me that\Nthe serial killer's second victim,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.02,0:10:56.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}Nakanishi Aya, went to Izumi Elementary School.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.84,0:11:02.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We were still stuck in the loop of\Nthe serial kidnapping and murder case.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.81,0:11:11.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}March 2nd...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.68,0:11:13.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At some point between 10 p.m. and 11 p.m.,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.15,0:11:16.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}Hinazuki Kayo disappeared\Nfrom the storage shed at home.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.88,0:11:23.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}The rubber boot footprints found nearby, \Nmatched with boots found at the Shiratori home.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.97,0:11:30.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}The killer took her to a commercial freezer\Nand used a spray to speed up her death.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.33,0:11:36.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}He then returned her body to the shed before sunrise.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.29,0:11:41.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This bus is not safe.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.72,0:11:46.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's right in the middle of the loop of this case.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.58,0:11:52.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We should leave here at once.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.87,0:11:54.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.13,0:11:57.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,While we'd love for someone to find Hina,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.64,0:12:01.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,this stuff is kinda disturbing.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.94,0:12:04.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. We can't have a pervert finding her.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.55,0:12:08.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru, do you have a plan B?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.82,0:12:10.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.12,0:12:12.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.25,0:12:13.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's get outta here, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.28,0:12:22.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's the killer's footprint. Remember it.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.16,0:12:28.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's that black powder?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.09,0:12:32.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Briquettes...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.77,0:12:35.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't tell me this belongs to the killer, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.68,0:12:44.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.23,0:12:48.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru, that stuff doesn't matter now.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.22,0:12:51.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, right...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.09,0:12:54.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah. Losing my head won't do me any good.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.19,0:12:58.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,All right, that should do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.30,0:13:00.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Too bad. It was a good hideout.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.41,0:13:03.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Not when strangers show up late at night, it isn't.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.00,0:13:03.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.28,0:13:10.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right now, I should distance Hinazuki\Nfrom the case, even if I have to push my luck.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.29,0:13:12.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Child Welfare is making their move, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.54,0:13:16.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our actions are definitely changing the future.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.62,0:13:18.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This will work for sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.23,0:13:22.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.53,0:13:23.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is your plan B?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.84,0:13:26.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yep. Simple, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.40,0:13:28.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's dig deep and take another step.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.17,0:13:30.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We're being straightforward after all that?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.86,0:13:31.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.02,0:13:34.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.67,0:13:40.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,G-Good evening.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.76,0:13:44.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.02,0:13:52.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is what happened when I didn't give up.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.96,0:14:05.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you kids.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.93,0:14:08.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling you'd say that.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.29,0:14:10.68,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,51,,{\an8\i1}But I had a feeling I'd get yelled at first.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.29,0:14:10.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But I had a feeling I'd get yelled at first.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.33,0:14:12.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I said that out loud.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.03,0:14:14.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why would I ever yell at you for this?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.12,0:14:17.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You did it to help a friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.65,0:14:24.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I noticed it a little while ago, but this smell...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.50,0:14:27.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I figured you'd be home soon,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.37,0:14:30.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but I didn't know how many guests\Nyou'd bring, so I went with curry.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.77,0:14:33.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So she knew all along.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.20,0:14:37.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there.\NCome in and join us for dinner.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.61,0:14:38.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.47,0:14:39.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We'll take you up on that offer.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.47,0:14:44.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What were you gonna do with\Nall this curry if nobody came?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.85,0:14:47.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, curry is good for days, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.50,0:14:52.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Um, here.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.13,0:14:56.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you. It was delicious.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.31,0:15:02.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, leave it to me to clean up this mess.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.04,0:15:04.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't mean the mess on the dinner table.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.87,0:15:06.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We know.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.28,0:15:07.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.16,0:15:08.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.21,0:15:09.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.95,0:15:15.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hello? This is Fujinuma Satoru's mother speaking.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.98,0:15:21.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yashiro-sensei, Satoru and \NKayo-chan came back to our place.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.08,0:15:23.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Really? That's great!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.92,0:15:26.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I thought as much.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.04,0:15:31.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Will Kayo really have to be\N sent to an orphanage somewhere?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.89,0:15:34.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.90,0:15:38.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea of sorts\Non how to deal with that.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.81,0:15:41.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No, we couldn't meet Kayo's mother.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.78,0:15:45.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,On that note, Fujinuma-san, I have a favor to ask.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.96,0:15:48.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.72,0:15:50.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow at seven, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.93,0:15:55.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Stay the night, Kayo-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.64,0:15:56.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.14,0:16:03.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hello. Sorry for calling so late.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.32,0:16:06.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Yashiro Gaku,\Na teacher at Mikoto Elementary School.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.95,0:16:09.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'd like to speak to you about Kayo-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.01,0:16:12.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He's called Wonder Guy. Isn't he cool?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.03,0:16:17.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,One of you go ahead and take a bath.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.74,0:16:19.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You first.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.16,0:16:20.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.76,0:16:24.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wanna take one with me, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.42,0:16:33.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Want me to wash your hair, Kayo-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.75,0:16:36.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I can do it myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.53,0:16:38.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.57,0:16:43.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling itchy anywhere, ma'am?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.71,0:16:49.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Here? Or maybe...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.80,0:16:56.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Here? Or here?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.89,0:17:03.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're 29 years old! Get a hold of yourself!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.63,0:17:09.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You'll catch a cold if you don't dry your hair.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.80,0:17:18.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You seemed to be having fun in there.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.03,0:17:21.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was really warm.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.09,0:17:24.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That so?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.79,0:17:27.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, those pajamas...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.21,0:17:29.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I bought them beforehand.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.39,0:17:31.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's a demon.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.38,0:17:34.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Use this bed sheet. It's been washed.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.61,0:17:35.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.38,0:17:39.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru, you're too sloppy. Pull that end more.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.43,0:17:41.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Feels like we're on a field trip.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.50,0:17:47.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, the view from\NMount Hakodate at night is something else, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.12,0:17:49.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You've never even been to Hakodate!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.62,0:17:50.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}C-Crap!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.77,0:17:53.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I-I saw it in a photo...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.61,0:17:57.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,All right, lights out!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.40,0:17:58.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.40,0:17:58.49,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.20,0:18:02.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.49,0:18:04.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We don't use a nightlight at home.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.63,0:18:07.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, should I turn it off, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.21,0:18:09.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's all right.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.88,0:18:11.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's leave it on.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.52,0:18:13.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.03,0:18:14.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.05,0:18:18.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Night.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.18,0:18:19.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.87,0:18:33.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Am I being a third wheel here?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.65,0:18:34.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.46,0:18:36.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,O-Of course not!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.91,0:18:38.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Who actually says "yeah"?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.53,0:18:38.87,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,51,,{\an8\i1}I said that out loud.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.39,0:18:41.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What was that for?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.73,0:18:43.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Shut it!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.38,0:18:45.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.00,0:18:45.62,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,51,,{\an8}Stop it!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.91,0:18:48.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.76,0:19:07.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.58,0:19:10.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.05,0:19:11.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.71,0:19:15.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru, Kayo-chan! Eat up while it's still hot!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.65,0:19:17.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.29,0:19:28.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.03,0:19:29.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, what about the curry?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.80,0:19:32.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Saving it as your dinner for the foreseeable future.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.14,0:19:35.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There was enough for a half-dozen people!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.26,0:19:37.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You could just invite your friends over again.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.83,0:20:55.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,To hell...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.72,0:21:01.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.35,0:21:09.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kayo!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.38,0:21:11.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Where the hell were you these past few days?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.74,0:21:12.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.30,0:21:15.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You two!

